{"unit_id": "Waverly-W__dsh-scratchpad#feature-1", "repo": "Waverly-W/dsh-scratchpad", "commit": "6bc9fd6415a138e52c25164204c10238d3c93e11", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-scratchpad 的功能「侧栏快捷新建」：在 DSH Web 侧栏的新会话按钮旁提供临时对话入口，折叠时改为紧凑图标。点击后创建或复用统一工作区，并在其中新建、打开会话。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client/index.js:226-297", "client/index.js:164-223"]}
